<title>USA: Parkvale Financial Q3 shr $0.61 vs $0.71.</title>
<headline>Parkvale Financial Q3 shr $0.61 vs $0.71.</headline>
<dateline>MONROEVILLE, Pa. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.61		    $0.71</p>
<p> Net		 2,554		    2,983</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  4,208,000		4,201,000</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS ending March 31</p>
<p> Net shr	   $1.04		    $1.74</p>
<p> Net		 4,365		    7,308</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  4,212,000		4,202,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company said the recognition of previously deferred gain and the recapitalization of the Savings Association Insurance Fund skewed the comparibility of the 1997 and 1996 periods.</p>
